I Am Chris Farley is a documentary film directed by Brent Hodge.

2
00:13:42,857 --> 00:13:48,857
I am Chris Farley tells his hilarious, touching and wildly entertaining story - from his early days in Madison, Wisconsin, to his time at
Second City and Saturday Night Live, then finally his film career (which included hits like Tommy Boy and Black Sheep).

